{# Credit for the providers whose artwork reaches the user through Find Posters.
   Lives in a partial because it is rendered in both footers — the page footer on
   desktop and the navigation drawer's footer on a phone, where the page footer is
   hidden — and the two must never credit different sets of providers.

   Mediux is deliberately absent: the poster source returns no artwork from it.

   The order here is the order Find Posters sections its results in, and the two
   must not disagree — this credit is the definition and PosterProvider follows
   it. TVmaze is last in both.

   This credits the *set of services* Marquee draws on. It is not the credit a
   licence attaches to an individual image: that is the per-candidate link in the
   Find Posters grid and preview, driven by the address the poster source sends
   with the poster. Neither stands in for the other.

   Each logo carries its intrinsic width/height so the footer reserves the row's
   space before the images decode; the displayed size comes from the per-provider
   classes in app.css, which normalise four very different aspect ratios into one
   row.

   Each link names its provider twice, and the two are not interchangeable.
   data-tooltip is the app's own tooltip, for someone looking straight at a mark
   that may not spell its own name; alt is the link's accessible name, and is
   what assistive technology announces and what a touch user's screen reader
   reads — no tooltip is ever shown on touch. Keep the two in step; a test
   asserts they agree. Never restore title= here: the shared tooltip replaces the
   browser's everywhere in the app, and this credit was the last place it
   survived. Never add an aria-label either, however tempting it looks on a link
   whose only content is an image — it would override the alt text, leaving the
   real name silently unannounced. #}
<div class="attribution">
    <p class="attribution__label">Posters provided by:</p>
    <div class="attribution__logos">
        <a href="https://www.themoviedb.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-tooltip="TMDB">
            <img class="attribution__logo attribution__logo--tmdb" src="{{ asset('/assets/providers/tmdb.svg') }}"
                 alt="TMDB" width="273" height="36">
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.thetvdb.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-tooltip="TheTVDB">
            <img class="attribution__logo attribution__logo--tvdb" src="{{ asset('/assets/providers/tvdb.png') }}"
                 alt="TheTVDB" width="400" height="216">
        </a>
        <a href="https://fanart.tv/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-tooltip="fanart.tv">
            <img class="attribution__logo attribution__logo--fanart" src="{{ asset('/assets/providers/fanart.png') }}"
                 alt="fanart.tv" width="303" height="61">
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.tvmaze.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-tooltip="TVmaze">
            <img class="attribution__logo attribution__logo--tvmaze" src="{{ asset('/assets/providers/tvmaze.png') }}"
                 alt="TVmaze" width="253" height="80">
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
